      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} The feature request would be for, either a page in the docs, or a tooltip on hovering over the buttons, or a question mark button next to them that you can click to make a popup appear explaining them, or a message that pops up the first time you try using it, or something.  They've put mysterious buttons in the UI of unclear purpose, I don't much mind *which* means of clarifying their use they use, but there should be *some* way of learning what clicking thumbs up and thumbs down is actually *doing*.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
